Notebook[{Cell["dirac16complex Kohn-Sham DFT in the static primordial field: \
symbolic 2x2 reduction, NDSolve spectra and a Wolfram Language \
self-consistent loop cross-checking the Rust CVODE solver", "Title"],
  Cell["This notebook is generated by \
scripts/build_dirac16complex_ks_mathematica_notebook.wls and evaluated \
headless by scripts/verify_dirac16complex_ks_mathematica_notebook.wls. It \
cross-checks Stage 4 of the dirac16complex project (the 16-component complex \
Grassmann spinor field of Pin(4,4), treated in Kohn-Sham density-functional \
theory in the static primordial gravitational field) against the Rust solver \
studies/dirac16complex_kohn_sham, which finds every single-particle level by \
CVODE shooting (Pruefer angle) on the pure-Rust SUNDIALS 7.8.0 engine of \
rustSolveIt and iterates the Kohn-Sham equations with Anderson mixing.",
   "Text"], Cell["What is done here, in order. (1) The exact-theory package \
wolfram/Dirac16ComplexKohnSham.wl is loaded and its complete check suite is \
run. (2) The 2x2 Kohn-Sham block equations are derived symbolically: the \
covariant Dirac operator of the Stage-1 geometry package in the warped \
y-chart, the mode ansatz, the exact block diagonalisation, the real \
two-component form the Rust code integrates, and the Pruefer-angle form with \
its boundary conditions. (3) The k = 0, lambda = 0 box problem is solved \
analytically (zero mode and +-sqrt(M^2 + (n pi/L)^2) for the even brane \
parity, tan(pL) = -p/M for the odd one). (4) The k != 0 single-particle \
problem is solved numerically with NDSolve shooting (bag condition at y = -L, \
parity condition at the brane y = 0) and compared level by level with the six \
free-spectrum files of the Rust spectrum/ output and its closed-shell tables. \
(5) A small self-consistent Kohn-Sham loop is run in Wolfram Language for N = \
8, T = 0, L = 3, m = H = 1 at the coupling lambda_hat_2 of the Rust outputs, \
and its eigenvalues, M_eff(y), v_x(y), densities and E_0 are compared with \
the Rust scf/ run of the same parameters, together with the complete \
single-particle spectrum of the final potential. (6) The binary is run with \
print-config (RunProcess, SUCCESS contract) and its printed equations are \
compared with the derived ones. (7) Figures, the report \
artifacts/dirac16complex/kohn-sham/mathematica-report.json and the final \
association notebookChecks.", "Text"], Cell["Provenance. None of the three \
rustSolveIt repositories contains a Mathematica notebook (recorded in Stage \
3), so there is no upstream pattern to copy; this notebook follows the \
Stage-3 notebook notebooks/Dirac16ComplexDarkSector.nb and its \
builder/verifier (held Input cells, RunProcess + Import[CSV/RawJSON] exchange \
with the compiled binary, a fail-fast notebookChecks association).", "Text"],
  Cell["Honesty rules. Every number shown or written to the report is \
computed in this notebook from the committed Rust outputs \
(artifacts/dirac16complex/kohn-sham/rust/spectrum and rust/scf), from the \
exact package, or from this notebook's own NDSolve computations; nothing is \
typed in by hand. Parameter values quoted in the prose are compared with the \
output files by a check near the end. The Wolfram and Rust computations share \
the discretisation conventions that define the discrete Kohn-Sham problem \
(the 301-point y grid, the natural cubic spline of M_eff(y) and v_x(y) \
between grid points, Simpson quadrature for the energy integrals, the torus \
spacing Delta k = 0.25 m); these are stated where they are used. They share \
no code: the integrator (NDSolve versus CVODE), the root finder, the mixing \
and the symbolic derivation are independent.", "Text"],
  Cell["Physics summary (conventions of CONTRACT.md and STAGE4_SPEC.md \
sections 1-8; H = 1 units). Static primordial field in the proper hidden \
coordinate y = ln(sin z)/(6H) in [-L, 0]: ds^2 = dy^2 - dx4^2 + e^{2Hy}[e^{2 \
a4} dx_vec^2 - e^{-2 a4} dy_vec^2] (x4 = time, x5..x7 the extra times), \
sqrt|g| = e^{6Hy}, R = -42 H^2, so 8D Einstein gravity would need rho_req = \
-21 H^2/kappa and p_req = +15 H^2/kappa (STAGE4_SPEC erratum E4.3). Z2 brane \
at y = 0 (rho_brane = +12 H/kappa, p_brane = -10 H/kappa, verified by the \
package), tip cutoff at y = -L. Mode ansatz Psi = e^{-i eps x4} e^{i k x1} \
e^{-3Hy} chi(y); eight 2x2 blocks of two inequivalent types j = +-1 (4-fold \
each at fixed k), block ODE chi' = [M_eff sigma3 - kappa k sigma2 + i j (eps \
- v_v) sigma1] chi with kappa = e^{-Hy - a4}. Exact local exchange e_x = \
-(lambda/32)(n^2 + S^2), v_v = -(lambda/16) n, v_s = -(lambda/16) S, M_eff = \
m + (15/16) lambda S_p. The Kohn-Sham fermion-gas thermodynamics \
pseudo-potential is the pair (M_eff(y), v_x(y; n_p, T)) from the Mermin \
finite-T functional; there is no correlation term (a contact interaction \
beyond Hartree-Fock is not renormalisable in 8D).", "Text"],
  Cell["Repository, packages and committed outputs", "Section"],
  Cell["The repository root comes from $Dirac16RepositoryRoot (set by the \
verifier) or from the notebook's location. Two packages are loaded: the \
Stage-1 geometry package (symbolic vielbein geometry, canonical spin \
connection Omega_mu = (1/2) omega_{mu ab} S^{ab}, Dirac operator gamma^mu \
D_mu) and the Stage-4 exact Kohn-Sham theory package. The Rust outputs are \
read from artifacts/dirac16complex/kohn-sham/rust/.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", "=",
        RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[",
              "$Dirac16RepositoryRoot", "]"}], ",", "$Dirac16RepositoryRoot",
            ",", RowBox[{"ParentDirectory", "[", RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory",
                "[", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"ksRoot", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"artifacts\"", ",",
              "\"dirac16complex\"", ",", "\"kohn-sham\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{"rustRoot", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"ksRoot", ",", "\"rust\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{"figureDirectory", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"ksRoot", ",", "\"figures\"", ",",
              "\"mathematica\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"reportPath", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"ksRoot", ",",
              "\"mathematica-report.json\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"wolfram\"", ",",
              "\"Dirac16ComplexGeometry.wl\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"wolfram\"", ",",
              "\"Dirac16ComplexKohnSham.wl\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"!", RowBox[{"DirectoryQ", "[",
              "figureDirectory", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"CreateDirectory",
            "[", RowBox[{"figureDirectory", ",", RowBox[{
                "CreateIntermediateDirectories", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}],
            "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", RowBox[{"spectrumSummary", "=",
        RowBox[{"Import", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
              RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"rustRoot", ",", "\"spectrum\"", ",",
                  "\"summary.json\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\"RawJSON\""}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"scfSummary", "=",
        RowBox[{"Import", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
              RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"rustRoot", ",", "\"scf\"", ",",
                  "\"summary.json\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\"RawJSON\""}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"relativePath", "[", "path_String",
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"Drop", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"FileNameSplit", "[",
                  RowBox[{"ExpandFileName", "[", "path", "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameSplit", "[",
                    RowBox[{"ExpandFileName", "[", "repositoryRoot", "]"}],
                    "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\"/\""}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"sourceFiles", "=", RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"registerSource", "[", "path_String", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                 {"!", RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", RowBox[{"sourceFiles", ",",
                      "path"}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[",
                  RowBox[{"sourceFiles", ",", "path"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";",
            "path"}], ")"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"registerSource", "/@",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{",
                RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"wolfram\"", ",",
                  "\"Dirac16ComplexGeometry.wl\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                 {"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"wolfram\"", ",",
                  "\"Dirac16ComplexKohnSham.wl\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"rustRoot",
                  ",", "\"spectrum\"", ",", "\"summary.json\""}], "}"}],
              "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{",
                RowBox[{"rustRoot", ",", "\"scf\"", ",",
                  "\"summary.json\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"spectrumVerdict\"",
            "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"spectrumSummary", "[", "\"verdict\"",
              "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"scfVerdict\"", "\[Rule]",
            RowBox[{"scfSummary", "[", "\"verdict\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]],
   "Input"], Cell["The exact Kohn-Sham theory package", "Section"],
  Cell["D16KSRun[root] runs every exact check of \
wolfram/Dirac16ComplexKohnSham.wl (geometry and Z2 brane, reduction to eight \
2x2 blocks with the explicit basis, current matrices and boundary conditions, \
the exact local exchange, the Mermin-Kohn-Sham functional, the \
energy-momentum tensor of a Kohn-Sham orbital). Its progress messages are \
suppressed here; the checks and measurements are kept. The zero-mode \
splitting coefficient c (the first-order slope d eps/dk of the k = 0 brane \
zero mode, exact in closed form) is taken from its measurements and used in \
the box section below.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"theoryRun", "=",
        RowBox[{"Block", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", "Print", "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"Dirac16ComplexKohnSham`D16KSRun", "[", "repositoryRoot",
              "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"theoryChecks", "=",
        RowBox[{"theoryRun", "[", "\"checks\"", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"theoryCheckSummary", "=", RowBox[{"Association", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"checkCount\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Length", "[",
                "theoryChecks", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"failed\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Keys", "[", RowBox[{"Select", "[",
                  RowBox[{"theoryChecks", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"!", RowBox[
                         {"TrueQ", "[", "#1", "]"}]}], "&"}]}], "]"}],
                "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"zeroModeSplittingCoefficient\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"theoryRun", "[",
                  "\"measurements\"", "]"}], "[",
                "\"reduction_zeroModeSplittingCoefficient\"", "]"}]}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", "theoryCheckSummary"}]], "Input"],
  Cell["Symbolic derivation of the 2x2 Kohn-Sham block equations",
   "Section"], Cell["Geometry of the static field in the y chart",
   "Subsection"], Cell["Diagonal vielbein of the warped form, coordinates (y, \
x1, ..., x7) with x0 = y the proper hidden coordinate and x4 the time: e = \
diag(1, W e^{a4} (x3), 1, W e^{-a4} (x3)), W = e^{Hy}, a4 constant (the \
static member of the primordial family). The Christoffel symbols and the \
mixed Einstein tensor are computed here independently of the packages (the \
same helper functions as in the Stage-3 notebook) and compared with the \
Stage-4 results: sqrt|g| = e^{6Hy}, G^mu_nu = H^2 \
diag(15,15,15,15,21,15,15,15), R = -42 H^2, hence rho_req = -G^4_4/kappa = \
-21 H^2/kappa and p_req = G^i_i/kappa = +15 H^2/kappa (T^mu_nu = \
G^mu_nu/kappa, rho = -T^4_4, p_i = T^i_i).", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"gammas", "=",
        RowBox[{"Dirac16ComplexKohnSham`D16KSGammas", "[", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", "a_Integer", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"gammas", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"a", "+", "1"}],
          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"id16", "=", RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "16", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"zero16", "=", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[",
          RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"16", ",", "16"}], "}"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"zero2", "=", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[",
          RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"coords", "=",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"yy", ",", "x1", ",", "x2", ",", "x3", ",",
            "x4", ",", "x5", ",", "x6", ",", "x7"}], "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"warp", "=", RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ", "yy"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"kappaKS", "=",
        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "hH"}], " ", "yy"}],
            "-", "a4"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"frameKS", "=",
        RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", RowBox[
           {"{", RowBox[{"1", ",", RowBox[{"warp", " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
                  "a4", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"warp", " ", RowBox[
                 {"Exp", "[", "a4", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"warp", " ",
                RowBox[{"Exp", "[", "a4", "]"}]}], ",", "1", ",",
              RowBox[{"warp", " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"-", "a4"}],
                  "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"warp", " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
                  RowBox[{"-", "a4"}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"warp", " ",
                RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"-", "a4"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"geoKS", "=",
        RowBox[{"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoSymbolicGeometry", "[",
          RowBox[{"frameKS", ",", "coords"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"metricKS", "=", RowBox[{"geoKS", "[", "\"metric\"", "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{"simpKS", "=", RowBox[
         {RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{"#1", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[
                 {"hH", ">", "0"}], "&&", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                     {"yy", ",", "a4"}], "}"}], "\[Element]", TemplateBox[{},
                   "Reals"]}]}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"christoffelOf", "[", RowBox[{"metric_", ",", "xs_"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"inv", "=", TemplateBox[
                   {"metric"}, "Inverse", SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox]}],
                ",", RowBox[{"n", "=", RowBox[{"Length", "[", "xs",
                    "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", RowBox[
                   {UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "s", "n"], RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"inv", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r",
                          ",", "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ",
                      RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{SubscriptBox[
                          "\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "nn",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"metric",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"s", ",", "m"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "+", RowBox[
                          {SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "m",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"metric",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"s", ",", "nn"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "-", RowBox[
                          {SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "s",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"metric",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"m", ",", "nn"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"r", ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"m", ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"nn", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"einsteinMixedOf", "[",
          RowBox[{"metric_", ",", "xs_", ",", "simp_"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"gc", "=", RowBox[{"christoffelOf",
                    "[", RowBox[{"metric", ",", "xs"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"n", "=", RowBox[{"Length", "[", "xs", "]"}]}], ",",
                "ricci", ",", "mixed", ",", "scalar"}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"ricci", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "r", "n"],
                        RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{SubscriptBox[
                          "\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "r",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r", ",", "nu",
                          ",", "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "-",
                          RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"xs", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "nu",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r", ",", "r", ",",
                          "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "+",
                      RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "r", "n"],
                        RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "l", "n"],
                          RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r", ",", "r", ",",
                          "l"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", RowBox[
                          {"gc", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"l", ",",
                          "nu", ",", "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "-",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"gc", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          RowBox[{"r", ",", "nu", ",", "l"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"l", ",", "r", ",",
                          "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}],
                    ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"s", ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"nu", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
              ";", RowBox[{"mixed", "=", RowBox[{"simp", "[", RowBox[
                   {TemplateBox[{"metric"}, "Inverse", SyntaxForm ->
                      SuperscriptBox], ".", "ricci"}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"scalar", "=", RowBox[{"simp", "[", RowBox[{"Tr", "[",
                    "mixed", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"simp", "[",
                RowBox[{"mixed", "-", RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "2"], " ",
                    "scalar", " ", RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n",
                      "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"einsteinKS", "=", RowBox[{"einsteinMixedOf", "[",
          RowBox[{"metricKS", ",", "coords", ",", "simpKS"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"ricciScalarKS", "=", RowBox[{"simpKS", "[",
          RowBox[{"-", FractionBox[RowBox[{"Tr", "[", "einsteinKS", "]"}],
             "3"]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"geometryChecks", "=",
        RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"\"gammasEqualGeometryPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{"gammas", "===",
                "Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoGammas"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"christoffelAgreesWithPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"christoffelOf",
                      "[", RowBox[{"metricKS", ",", "coords"}], "]"}], "-",
                    RowBox[{"geoKS", "[", "\"christoffel\"", "]"}]}], "]"}],
                "===", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0", ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"8", ",", "8", ",", "8"}], "}"}]}],
                  "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"sqrtDetIsE6Hy\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Det",
                        "[", "metricKS", "]"}], "-", RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
                        RowBox[{"12", " ", "hH", " ", "yy"}], "]"}]}], "]"}],
                  "===", "0"}], "&&", RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"PowerExpand", "[", SqrtBox[RowBox[
                          {"Det", "[", "metricKS", "]"}]], "]"}], "-",
                      RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH", " ",
                          "yy"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "===", "0"}]}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"einsteinTensorIsDiag15_21\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[{"einsteinKS", "-",
                    RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["hH", "2"], " ", RowBox[
                       {"DiagonalMatrix", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"15",
                          ",", "15", ",", "15", ",", "15", ",", "21", ",",
                          "15", ",", "15", ",", "15"}], "}"}], "]"}]}]}],
                  "]"}], "===", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[
                   {"0", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"8", ",", "8"}], "}"}]}],
                  "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"ricciScalarMinus42H2\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[
                   {"ricciScalarKS", "+", RowBox[{"42", " ", SuperscriptBox[
                       "hH", "2"]}]}], "]"}], "===", "0"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"requiredSourceRhoMinus21PPlus15\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                       {"-", FractionBox[RowBox[{"einsteinKS",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"5", ",", "5"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "kap"]}], "+",
                      FractionBox[RowBox[{"21", " ", SuperscriptBox["hH",
                          "2"]}], "kap"]}], "]"}], "===", "0"}], "&&",
                RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                       {"1", ",", "2", ",", "3", ",", "4", ",", "6", ",",
                        "7", ",", "8"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[
                       {RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[
                          {"einsteinKS", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[
                          {"#1", ",", "#1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}],
                          "kap"], "-", FractionBox[RowBox[{"15", " ",
                          SuperscriptBox["hH", "2"]}], "kap"]}], "]"}],
                        "===", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "einsteinKS", "]"}], ",",
          "ricciScalarKS", ",", "geometryChecks"}], "}"}]}]], "Input"],
  Cell["The reduced Dirac equation", "Subsection"],
  Cell["gamma^mu D_mu Psi = M_eff Psi with the ansatz Psi = e^{-i eps x4} \
e^{i k x1} e^{-3Hy} chi(y) (sector without extra-time momentum, k = (k,0,0) \
by rotational symmetry). Dividing by the prefactor leaves A chi' + B chi = 0 \
with A = gamma^0 and B = i kappa k gamma^1 - i eps gamma^4 - M_eff: the \
factor W^{-3} = e^{-3Hy} removes the spin-connection term gamma^mu Omega_mu = \
3H gamma^0 exactly (without it the term 3H gamma^0 chi remains), and the \
measure sqrt|g| Psi^dagger Psi = chi^dagger chi is flat in y. The Kohn-Sham \
equation adds the local exchange potential as the shift eps -> eps - v_v(y) \
and uses M_eff = m + (15/16) lambda S_p: chi' = gamma^0 [M_eff - i kappa k \
gamma^1 + i (eps - v_v) gamma^4] chi.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"chiFun", "=",
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"chiC", "[", "i",
                "]"}], "[", "yy", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"i", ",",
                "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"chiDer", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"chiC", "[", "i", "]"}],
               "\[Prime]", MultilineFunction -> None], "[", "yy", "]"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"prefactorKS", "=",
        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}],
              " ", "eps", " ", "x4"}], "+", RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ",
              "kk", " ", "x1"}], "-", RowBox[{"3", " ", "hH", " ", "yy"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"reducedKS", "=",
        RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", FractionBox[RowBox[
            {RowBox[{"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoSymbolicDirac", "[",
               RowBox[{"geoKS", ",", RowBox[{"prefactorKS", " ", "chiFun"}],
                 ",", "coords"}], "]"}], "-", RowBox[{RowBox[{"meff", "[",
                 "yy", "]"}], " ", "prefactorKS", " ", "chiFun"}]}],
           "prefactorKS"], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"derivMatKS", "=",
        RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[
            {RowBox[{"{", "chiDer", "}"}]}]], "reducedKS"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"restMatKS", "=", RowBox[{"Simplify", "[",
          RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", "chiFun",
                 "}"}]}]], RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"reducedKS", "/.",
                "\[VeryThinSpace]", RowBox[{"Thread", "[", RowBox[{"chiDer",
                    "\[Rule]", "0"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"reducedNoW", "=", RowBox[{"Simplify", "[",
          FractionBox[RowBox[{"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoSymbolicDirac",
             "[", RowBox[{"geoKS", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
                   RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ",
                       "eps", " ", "x4"}], "+", RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ",
                       "kk", " ", "x1"}]}], "]"}], " ", "chiFun"}], ",",
               "coords"}], "]"}], RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
             RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", "eps", " ",
                 "x4"}], "+", RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "kk", " ",
                 "x1"}]}], "]"}]], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"odeMatrix16", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", "0", "]"}],
          ".", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"meff", "[", "yy", "]"}],
                " ", "id16"}], "-", RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "kk", " ",
                "kappaKS", " ", RowBox[{"gam", "[", "1", "]"}]}], "+",
              RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"eps", "-",
                    RowBox[{"vv", "[", "yy", "]"}]}], ")"}], " ",
                RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"reductionChecks", "=", RowBox[{"Association", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"reducedEquationIsLinear\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{"reducedKS", "-",
                    RowBox[{"derivMatKS", ".", "chiDer"}], "-", RowBox[
                     {"restMatKS", ".", "chiFun"}]}], "]"}], "===",
                RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0", ",", "16"}],
                  "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"derivativeMatrixIsGamma0\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"derivMatKS", "===", RowBox[{"gam", "[",
                  "0", "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"restMatrixIsIKappaKGamma1MinusIEpsGamma4MinusM\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[
                   {"restMatKS", "-", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[
                         {"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "kk", " ", "kappaKS", " ",
                          RowBox[{"gam", "[", "1", "]"}]}], "-", RowBox[
                         {"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "eps", " ", RowBox[{"gam",
                          "[", "4", "]"}]}], "-", RowBox[{RowBox[{"meff",
                          "[", "yy", "]"}], " ", "id16"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}],
                "===", "zero16"}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"odeFormAtZeroExchange\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[
                 {"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                       {"odeMatrix16", "/.", "\[VeryThinSpace]", RowBox[
                         {RowBox[{"vv", "[", "yy", "]"}], "\[Rule]", "0"}]}],
                      ")"}], "+", RowBox[{TemplateBox[{"derivMatKS"},
                       "Inverse", SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox], ".",
                      "restMatKS"}]}], "]"}], "===", "zero16"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"withoutW3the3HGamma0TermRemains\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{"reducedNoW", "-",
                    RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", "0",
                          "]"}], ".", "chiDer"}], "+", RowBox[{"3", " ",
                          "hH", " ", RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", "0", "]"}],
                          ".", "chiFun"}]}], "+", RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]",
                          " ", "kk", " ", "kappaKS", " ", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"gam", "[", "1", "]"}], ".", "chiFun"}]}], "-",
                        RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "eps", " ", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}], ".",
                          "chiFun"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "===",
                RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0", ",", "16"}],
                  "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"flatMeasure\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simpKS", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[
                       {"PowerExpand", "[", SqrtBox[RowBox[{"Det", "[",
                          "metricKS", "]"}]], "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
                        RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "6"}], " ", "hH", " ", "yy"}],
                        "]"}]}], "-", "1"}], "]"}], "===", "0"}]}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[
       {"{", RowBox[{TagBox[RowBox[{"odeMatrix16", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
             RowBox[{RowBox[{"1", ";;", "4"}], ",", RowBox[{"1", ";;",
                 "4"}]}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], Function[BoxForm`e$,
            MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], ",", "reductionChecks"}], "}"}]}]],
   "Input"], Cell["Exact block diagonalisation", "Subsection"],
  Cell["D16KSBlockBasis[] is the exact unitary basis of the package (columns \
v+, v- = gamma^0 gamma^1 v+ per block, entries in {0, +-1, +-i}/(2 sqrt 2)), \
the common eigenbasis of J = gamma^0 gamma^1 gamma^4, gamma^2 gamma^3 and \
gamma^5 gamma^6. Transforming the 16x16 ODE matrix shows that it is block \
diagonal with eight 2x2 blocks N_j = M_eff sigma3 - kappa k sigma2 + i j (eps \
- v_v) sigma1, where j = +-1 is the eigenvalue of J on the block (four blocks \
each): two inequivalent types, and N_{-1}(eps) = N_{+1}(2 v_v - eps), i.e. \
h_{-1} - v_v = -(h_{+1} - v_v). The scalar-density operator B C is j sigma2 \
on every block and the number-density operator is the identity.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockBasis", "=",
        RowBox[{"Dirac16ComplexKohnSham`D16KSBlockBasis", "[", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"toBlocks", "[", "mat_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{TemplateBox[{"blockBasis"},
             "ConjugateTranspose", SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox], ".", "mat",
            ".", "blockBasis"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockPart", "[", RowBox[{"mat_", ",", "b_Integer"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"mat", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"2", " ", "b"}], "-", "1"}], ";;",
              RowBox[{"2", " ", "b"}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {RowBox[{RowBox[{"2", " ", "b"}], "-", "1"}], ";;",
              RowBox[{"2", " ", "b"}]}]}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"offBlockEntries", "[", "mat_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"Ceiling",
                      "[", FractionBox["r", "2"], "]"}], "\[NotEqual]",
                    RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", FractionBox["c", "2"], "]"}]}],
                  ",", RowBox[{"mat", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[
                     {"r", ",", "c"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",",
                  "Nothing"}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"r", ",",
                  "16"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"c", ",", "16"}],
                "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"sigma1", ",", "sigma2", ",", "sigma3"}],
          "}"}], "=", RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "/@",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[", "j_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"meff", "[", "yy", "]"}], " ", "sigma3"}],
          "-", RowBox[{"kappaKS", " ", "kk", " ", "sigma2"}], "+",
          RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "j", " ",
            RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"eps", "-", RowBox[{"vv", "[", "yy",
                  "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "sigma1"}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"jOperator", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", "0", "]"}], ".",
          RowBox[{"gam", "[", "1", "]"}], ".", RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4",
            "]"}]}]}], ";", RowBox[{"jBlocks", "=",
        RowBox[{"toBlocks", "[", "jOperator", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"jEigen", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"jBlocks", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"2", " ", "b"}], "-", "1"}], ",",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"2", " ", "b"}], "-", "1"}]}],
              "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"b", ",",
                "8"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"odeBlocks", "=", RowBox[{"toBlocks", "[", "odeMatrix16",
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"kreinB", "=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ",
          RowBox[{"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoC", ".",
            RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}]}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"scalarBlocks", "=", RowBox[{"toBlocks", "[",
          RowBox[{"kreinB", ".", "Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoC"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"blockChecks", "=",
        RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"basisUnitary\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[
                   {TemplateBox[{"blockBasis"}, "ConjugateTranspose",
                     SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox], ".", "blockBasis"}],
                  "]"}], "===", "id16"}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"basisDiagonalisesJ\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[
                 {"jBlocks", "===", RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[",
                    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"#1", ",", "#1"}], "}"}],
                          "&"}], ")"}], "/@", "jEigen"}], "]"}], "]"}]}],
                "&&", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Sort", "[", "jEigen", "]"}], "===",
                  RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", RowBox[
                       {"-", "1"}], ",", RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", RowBox[
                       {"-", "1"}], ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}],
                    "}"}]}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"odeMatrixBlockDiagonal\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"offBlockEntries", "[", "odeBlocks", "]"}], ",",
                  RowBox[{RowBox[{"#1", "===", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"blocksEqualNj\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"Range", "[", "8", "]"}], ",", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"blockPart", "[", RowBox[{"odeBlocks", ",",
                          "#1"}], "]"}], "-", RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[",
                          RowBox[{"jEigen", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "#1",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "===",
                      "zero2"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"twoInequivalentTypesFourEach\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"Length", "[", RowBox[{"Union", "[",
                      RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockPart", "[",
                          RowBox[{"odeBlocks", ",", "b"}], "]"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"b", ",", "8"}], "}"}]}],
                        "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "===", "2"}], "&&",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"Counts", "[", "jEigen", "]"}], "===",
                  RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"1", "\[Rule]",
                        "4"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "\[Rule]",
                        "4"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"hMinusIsMinusHPlus\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[",
                      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "]"}], "-", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                       {RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[", "1", "]"}], "/.",
                        "\[VeryThinSpace]", RowBox[{"eps", "\[Rule]",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"2", " ", RowBox[{"vv", "[", "yy",
                          "]"}]}], "-", "eps"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "===",
                "zero2"}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"scalarDensityOperatorIsJSigma2\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Range", "[",
                      "8", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockPart",
                          "[", RowBox[{"scalarBlocks", ",", "#1"}], "]"}],
                        "===", RowBox[{RowBox[{"jEigen",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "#1",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", "sigma2"}]}],
                      "&"}]}], "]"}], "&&", RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[",
                  RowBox[{RowBox[{"offBlockEntries", "[", "scalarBlocks",
                      "]"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"#1", "===", "0"}],
                      "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"MatrixForm", "/@",
            RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[", "1", "]"}],
                ",", RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[", RowBox[{"-", "1"}],
                  "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "blockChecks"}], "}"}]}]], "Input"],
  Cell["The real two-component form integrated by the Rust code",
   "Subsection"], Cell["With chi = (a, i b) and a, b real, the block ODE of \
type j becomes the real system a' = M_eff a + (s (eps - v_v) - kappa k) b, b' \
= -(s (eps - v_v) + kappa k) a - M_eff b with s = -j. This is the form \
printed by the binary (print-config line reduction, below) and implemented in \
studies/dirac16complex_kohn_sham/src/shooting.rs. The next cell derives it \
and reads the Rust block basis compiled into src/generated.rs: its eight \
blocks carry the labels (s, c1, c2) of BLOCK_LABELS, and applying the basis \
to the 16x16 ODE matrix reproduces the block formula with j = -s. Measured \
labelling fact (recorded in the report): on every Rust block the eigenvalue \
of J = gamma^0 gamma^1 gamma^4 is -s, i.e. s is the eigenvalue of gamma^1 \
gamma^0 gamma^4 = -J, while the comment in generated.rs reads J = s. Both \
block types enter every sum over states with the same multiplicity, so the \
label convention does not change any result. The scalar density of an orbital \
is chi^dagger (j sigma2) chi = -2 s a b and the number density a^2 + b^2, the \
formulas of scf.rs.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"realPair", "=",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"aR", "[", "yy", "]"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", RowBox[{"bR", "[", "yy", "]"}]}]}],
          "}"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"realFormFromBlock", "[", "j_",
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"rhs", "=", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"blockFormula", "[", "j", "]"}], ".",
                  "realPair"}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"Simplify", "[",
              RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"rhs", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                    "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", RowBox[{"rhs",
                      "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2",
                      "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"rustRealForm", "[", "s_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"meff", "[", "yy",
                  "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"aR", "[", "yy", "]"}]}], "+",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"s", " ", RowBox[
                       {"(", RowBox[{"eps", "-", RowBox[{"vv", "[", "yy",
                          "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "-", RowBox[{"kappaKS", " ",
                      "kk"}]}], ")"}], " ", RowBox[{"bR", "[", "yy",
                  "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", RowBox[
                   {"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"s", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                          {"eps", "-", RowBox[{"vv", "[", "yy", "]"}]}],
                          ")"}]}], "+", RowBox[{"kappaKS", " ", "kk"}]}],
                    ")"}]}], " ", RowBox[{"aR", "[", "yy", "]"}]}], "-",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"meff", "[", "yy", "]"}], " ", RowBox[
                 {"bR", "[", "yy", "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"generatedKS", "=", RowBox[{"Import", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                 {"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"studies\"", ",",
                  "\"dirac16complex_kohn_sham\"", ",", "\"src\"", ",",
                  "\"generated.rs\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\"Text\""}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"registerSource", "[",
        RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot",
              ",", "\"studies\"", ",", "\"dirac16complex_kohn_sham\"", ",",
              "\"src\"", ",", "\"generated.rs\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"rustConstantKS", "[", "name_String", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"start", ",",
                "tail", ",", "stop"}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"start", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"StringPosition",
                    "[", RowBox[{"generatedKS", ",", RowBox[
                       {"\"pub const \"", "<>", "name", "<>", "\":\""}]}],
                    "]"}], "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}],
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"tail", "=",
                RowBox[{"StringDrop", "[", RowBox[{"generatedKS", ",",
                    "start"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"stop", "=",
                RowBox[{"StringPosition", "[", RowBox[{"tail", ",",
                    "\"pub const \""}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"If", "[",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"stop", "=!=", RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"tail", "=", RowBox[{"StringTake", "[", RowBox[
                       {"tail", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"stop",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}],
                "]"}], ";", RowBox[{"ToExpression", "/@", RowBox[
                 {"StringCases", "[", RowBox[{"tail", ",", RowBox[
                     {"RegularExpression", "[", "\"-?[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\"",
                      "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"rustGammaValuesKS", "=", RowBox[{"rustConstantKS", "[",
          "\"GAMMA\"", "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"rustBlockLabels", "=",
        RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", RowBox[{"StringReplace", "[",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"First", "[", RowBox[{"StringCases", "[",
                  RowBox[{"generatedKS", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[
                       {"\"BLOCK_LABELS: [[i32; 3]; BLOCK_COUNT] = \"", "~~",
                        RowBox[{"x", ":", RowBox[{"Shortest", "[", "__",
